    <string name="civilianDescription_">A regular townsperson. Participates in daytime discussions and voting. No special night actions.</string>
    <string name="sheriffDescription_">A daytime role that performs a strong night check starting from the NightVote phase. If the checked player is mafia, that mafia member is eliminated; if the checked player is a civilian, the Sheriff is eliminated instead.</string>
    <string name="detectiveDescription_">A seeker of truth. Each night the Detective chooses one player and learns that player`s role (revealed only to the Detective).</string>
    <string name="doctorDescription_">A protector. Each night the Doctor chooses one player to protect — any elimination attempts on that target fail.</string>
    <string name="loverDescription_">Forms a bond with a chosen player. The bonded player is prevented from using abilities and from voting while the bond holds.</string>
    <string name="journalistDescription_">An information specialist. Picks two players and learns whether they belong to the same team. The Journalist cannot pick the same player twice.</string>
    <string name="mimicDescription_">A versatile role that can act both day and night. Sees mafia members in a special way (as generic `mafia` labels without player names) and can participate in both day and night voting. In chat, the Mimic sees Informator differently than regular players.</string>
    <string name="mafiaDescription_">A standard mafia member. Communicates with other mafia at night and participates in both day and night voting.</string>
    <string name = "barmanDescription_">Appears as a daytime-voting role. Night ability: choose one player — that player is muted / cannot speak properly during the following morning and evening (their communication is disrupted).</string>
    <string name="informatorDescription_">A mafia scout. Communicates with mafia at night and is seen by mafia as `Informator` in chat. Night ability: choose a player to reveal that player`s role to the Informator.</string>
    <string name="bomberDescription_">A risky mafia role. Participates in daytime discussion and voting. Night ability: select any player and activate, eliminating that player and the Bomber themself.</string>
    <string name="donDescription_">The mafia leader. Has the Informator`s scouting ability (can reveal roles) and coordinates the mafia at night.</string>
    <string name="civilianAbility_">Daytime voting</string>
